/*!
    \page examples.html
    \title Example Applications
    \brief Explore the example applications included with the repository.

    The repository contains three Qt Quick applications:

    \section1 BasicApp

    Located in \c examples/BasicApp, this example demonstrates embedding
    DashboardView, providing a C++ data model, registering a custom theme, and
    saving layout state with QSettings.

    \section1 JsonApp

    Located in \c examples/JsonApp, this example demonstrates loading JSON
    data into the dashboard through the QML API.

    \section1 RestApiApp

    Located in \c examples/RestApiApp, this example demonstrates retrieving
    JSON data from a REST endpoint and optionally supplying a Bearer token.

    \section1 Build All Examples

    Configure with \c BUILD_EXAMPLES enabled and use Qt 6.10 or newer:

    \badcode
    cmake -S . -B build -DBUILD_EXAMPLES=ON
    cmake --build build --parallel
    \endcode
*/
